<title>USA: Wireless Telecom to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Wireless Telecom to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wireless Telecom Group Inc said on Tuesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $1 million of its common shares from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>The repurchase program will have no effect on the company's quarterly dividend policy, it said.</p>
<p>Wireless Telecom has approximately 17 million shares outstanding, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The stock was trading up 3/8 at 9-1/4 at midday.</p>
